# P1 — Payments, fraud, and diaspora orders

## 13. Fraud and abuse controls

For diaspora and prepaid orders, add:

- velocity limits;
- device and IP risk signals;
- repeated failed-payment detection;
- unusual payer/recipient country detection;
- high-value manual review;
- first-order review;
- multiple addresses in a short period;
- delivery confirmation code;
- chargeback evidence package;
- merchant and customer dispute history.

Do not reject every international order automatically. Use risk scoring and human review.

Chargeback evidence should include:

```text
order summary
payment authorization
provider transaction ID
customer confirmation
WhatsApp conversation references
recipient confirmation
delivery time
driver event timeline
proof of delivery
refund history
```

