# Tools to avoid for now

Do not add these before the core operation is stable:

- native iOS or Android apps;
- blockchain or crypto payments;
- a third AI provider;
- complex microservice architecture;
- a full data warehouse;
- automatic marketplace split payments;
- fully autonomous AI customer support;
- nationwide delivery;
- expensive enterprise support software;
- real-time driver tracking while inactive;
- automated bulk campaigns without human approval;
- Google Places as a permanent scraped database;
- a second map provider before the first is tested;
- loyalty, subscriptions, and paid campaigns before fulfilment is stable.

